(TASK: Initialize Node.js + Express + TypeScript Backend for CH Sharif & Saeed Hospital HMS) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (We have an existing React 19 + TypeScript frontend inside 'ch-sharif-and-saeed-hospital---hms'.) Tj
T* (Now build a modular, production-grade backend inside a new directory 'hms-backend'.) Tj
T* (All business rules must strictly follow '16 Client.pdf' \(Source of Truth v6.3\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Tech Stack:) Tj
T* (- Runtime: Node.js \(v20+\)) Tj
T* (- Framework: Express.js with TypeScript) Tj
T* (- ORM: Prisma ORM with PostgreSQL) Tj
T* (- Validation: Zod) Tj
T* (- Auth: JWT \(jsonwebtoken\) + bcryptjs) Tj
T* (- Utilities: cors, helmet, morgan, dotenv, express-rate-limit) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. Initialize 'hms-backend' with package.json, tsconfig.json, .env.example.) Tj
T* (2. Structure folders:) Tj
T* (   src/config, src/controllers, src/middleware, src/routes, src/services, src/types, src/utils, app.ts,) Tj
T* (server.ts) Tj
T* (3. In prisma/schema.prisma, define tables:) Tj
T* (   - Staff \(HR identity\) vs PortalUser \(Login credentials, 8 roles: SUPER_ADMIN, ADMIN,) Tj
T* (FRONT_DESK_BILLING, ADMISSION, INVENTORY_MANAGEMENT, PHARMACY_SUPER_ADMIN, PHARMACY_MANAGER,) Tj
T* (PHARMACY_SALES_DISPENSING\).) Tj
T* (   - Setup: HospitalProfile, Department, ServiceRate, Ward, Room, Bed, CorporatePanel.) Tj
T* (   - Patient: PanelPatient \(Permanent\) vs SelfPayEncounter \(Temporary case identity\).) Tj
T* (   - Billing: Appointment, HospitalInvoice, InvoiceLineItem, PaymentReceipt, UserCashBalance,) Tj
T* (AccountSettlement.) Tj
T* (   - Admission: AdmissionRecord, BedTransferHistory, MedicationModeHistory \(SELF vs HOSPITAL_MANAGED\),) Tj
T* (AdmissionPaymentRequest, DualDischargeClearance.) Tj
T* (   - Inventory: Supplier, StockItem, PurchaseOrder, StockLedger, SupplierLedger, DepartmentRequisition.) Tj
T* (   - Pharmacy: MedicineMaster, MedicineBatch \(FEFO\), MedicineStockLedger, PharmacyDispense,) Tj
T* (PharmacyClearance.) Tj
T* (   - Workforce: BiometricRawPunch, AttendanceRecord, AttendanceCorrectionLog, SalarySlip,) Tj
T* (DoctorCommissionRule, DoctorCommissionAccrual, CommissionPayout.) Tj
T* (   - Audit trail on every transaction: created_by_user_id, collected_by_user_id, approved_by_user_id.) Tj
T* (4. Create prisma/seed.ts with initial hospital profile, clinical/admin departments, wards/beds, and) Tj
T* (initial protected Super Admin & Admin accounts with hashed passwords.) Tj
ET
