(TASK: Implement Authentication, Protected Account Governance, and Universal User Cash Settlement API) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (Per '16 Client.pdf', two critical financial and security rules must be strictly enforced on backend:) Tj
T* (1. Protected Governance: Admin cannot edit, demote, delete, or reset password of Super Admin.) Tj
T* (2. Universal Cash Accountability: Admission portal never receives cash. Every cash user \(Billing, funded) Tj
T* (Inventory, Pharmacy cashier\) has their own UserCashBalance and submits their own AccountSettlement.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. Implement JWT Auth: POST /api/v1/auth/login, GET /api/v1/auth/me, POST /api/v1/auth/refresh.) Tj
T* (2. Create authenticate and authorizeRoles\(...roles\) middlewares.) Tj
T* (3. In User Management controller, enforce protected account rules:) Tj
T* (   - If user role is ADMIN and target user is SUPER_ADMIN -> return 403 Forbidden.) Tj
T* (   - Prevent deleting currently active Super Admin or last remaining Super Admin.) Tj
T* (4. Universal Cash Accountability Endpoints:) Tj
T* (   - GET /api/v1/finance/my-balance-sheet: Returns logged-in cashier's opening float, collections,) Tj
T* (advances, refunds, petty expenses, and expected physical cash.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/finance/settlements/submit: Cashier submits counted physical cash, calculates variance) Tj
T* (against unsettled transactions, and submits for custody transfer.) Tj
T* (   - GET /api/v1/finance/settlements/pending: For Super Admin/Admin to review.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/finance/settlements/:id/action: Reviewer accepts, partially accepts, or returns) Tj
T* (settlement.) Tj
