(TASK: Build REST APIs for Hospital Setup, Staff 360° Profiles, and Patient Registry) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (Refer to '16 Client.pdf' Sections 4, 5, 6, 31, 32. Eliminate all client-side mock arrays.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. Hospital Setup APIs:) Tj
T* (   - GET/PUT /api/v1/setup/hospital-profile \(Hospital details, logo, NTN, print headers/footers\).) Tj
T* (   - /api/v1/setup/departments \(Clinical & administrative\).) Tj
T* (   - /api/v1/setup/services-rates \(Standard rates, discount allowances, panel applicability\).) Tj
T* (   - /api/v1/setup/wards-rooms-beds \(Department -> Ward -> Room -> Bed hierarchy; status: Available,) Tj
T* (Occupied, Maintenance\).) Tj
T* (   - /api/v1/setup/corporate-panels \(Corporate panel organizations, discount rules, credit limits\).) Tj
T* (2. Staff 360° Profile API:) Tj
T* (   - /api/v1/staff \(CRUD\).) Tj
T* (   - GET /api/v1/staff/:id/360: Returns HR profile, linked portal user account, shift history, attendance) Tj
T* (summary, staff-specific salary profile, and doctor commission rules.) Tj
T* (3. Patient Registry API:) Tj
T* (   - Validate Pakistani CNIC \(XXXXX-XXXXXXX-X\) and phone \(03XX-XXXXXXX\).) Tj
T* (   - GET /api/v1/patients/check-duplicate?cnic=...&phone=...) Tj
T* (   - Permanent Panel Patients \(/api/v1/patients/panel\).) Tj
T* (   - Temporary Self-Pay Encounters \(/api/v1/patients/encounters\).) Tj
