(TASK: Build Front Desk Billing, Appointments, and Invoicing Calculation Engine) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (Refer to '16 Client.pdf' Section 7, 8, 22, 35. Front Desk is the ONLY portal collecting hospital patient) Tj
T* (cash.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. Appointments Flow:) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/appointments: Book appointment for panel or self-pay.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/appointments/:id/advance: Collect advance payment; generates receipt linked to cashier.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/appointments/:id/check-in: Converts appointment to active OPD/Observation/Emergency) Tj
T* (encounter.) Tj
T* (2. Invoicing & Doctor Commission Calculation Engine:) Tj
T* (   - Formula:) Tj
T* (     Net Service Amount = Gross Service Amount - Approved Discount) Tj
T* (     Doctor Commission = Net Eligible Service Amount * Doctor Commission % \(or fixed rate\)) Tj
T* (     Hospital Remaining Share = Net Service Amount - Doctor Commission) Tj
T* (   - Automatically apply Panel discount rules if panel patient.) Tj
T* (   - Require Admin approval if discount exceeds threshold.) Tj
T* (3. Receipts & Cashier Updates:) Tj
T* (   - Adjust prior advance payment against final hospital invoice.) Tj
T* (   - Cash payments automatically update current cashier's UserCashBalance.) Tj
T* (   - Digital/POS payments tracked separately without inflating physical cash.) Tj
