(TASK: Implement Inpatient Admission \(IPD\), Bed Allocation, and Dual Clearance Discharge) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (Refer to '16 Client.pdf' Sections 9, 10, 11, 12, 13, 23.) Tj
T* (Crucial: Admission NEVER collects cash. Final discharge requires Dual Clearance.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. Planned Admission & Billing Hand-off:) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/admissions/planned: Create planned admission.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/admissions/:id/request-advance: Sends payment request to Billing queue.) Tj
T* (2. Bed Lifecycle:) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/admissions/:id/check-in: Assign bed -> Status becomes Occupied.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/admissions/:id/bed-transfer: Transfer patient bed; log from_bed, to_bed, timestamp,) Tj
T* (actor.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/admissions/:id/add-service: Append running hospital services and bed day charges.) Tj
T* (3. Medication Mode:) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/admissions/:id/medication-mode: Toggle SELF vs HOSPITAL_MANAGED with reason and actor.) Tj
T* (   - In HOSPITAL_MANAGED mode, allow sending medicine requests to Standalone Pharmacy queue.) Tj
T* (4. Dual Clearance Discharge Gate:) Tj
T* (   - Clinical Ready = Doctor sign-off.) Tj
T* (   - Hospital Clearance = Billing confirms all hospital bills paid.) Tj
T* (   - Pharmacy Clearance = Pharmacy confirms all medicine dues cleared.) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/admissions/:id/discharge: Allowed ONLY when all 3 clearances are approved.) Tj
T* (Automatically frees bed to Available.) Tj
