(TASK: Implement General Inventory Ledgers and Standalone Pharmacy Integration) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (Refer to '16 Client.pdf' Sections 13, 14, 16, 17, 33, 34.) Tj
T* (HMS Inventory is non-medicine; Standalone Pharmacy owns medicine stock and FEFO dispensing.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. General Inventory:) Tj
T* (   - Supplier Master & Supplier Ledger \(track purchases, returns, payments, credits, outstanding\).) Tj
T* (   - Fund Request: Inventory staff requests petty cash advance -> Admin approves -> credited to user cash) Tj
T* (balance.) Tj
T* (   - Purchase/Receipt: Posts stock IN into StockLedger; cash payment reduces user cash balance.) Tj
T* (   - Department Issue/Return: Requisition -> Issue stock -> Deduct StockLedger with department tag.) Tj
T* (2. Standalone Pharmacy Integration:) Tj
T* (   - Medicine Master, Batches, Expiry, Cost, Sale Price.) Tj
T* (   - FEFO Engine: Auto-allocate nearest non-expired batch upon dispensing.) Tj
T* (   - Dispensing: Retail walk-in sale + HMS Inpatient Request queue.) Tj
T* (   - Dispensing creates Pharmacy Invoice and updates Pharmacy Clearance callback to HMS Admission.) Tj
