(TASK: Implement Attendance Normalization, Staff Salary Payroll, and Doctor Commission Streams) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (Refer to '16 Client.pdf' Sections 18, 19, 20, 21, 25, 26, 35.) Tj
T* (Crucial: Salary Payroll \(attendance-driven\) and Doctor Commission \(service-driven\) are independent) Tj
T* (liabilities!) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. Biometric Attendance Engine:) Tj
T* (   - POST /api/v1/attendance/punch-ingest: Receive raw device punch logs.) Tj
T* (   - Map punches against assigned shift \(grace period, late-in, early-exit, absent\).) Tj
T* (   - Admin Attendance Correction: PUT /api/v1/attendance/:id/correct \(log original, corrected, reason,) Tj
T* (user\).) Tj
T* (2. Salary Payroll Engine:) Tj
T* (   - Formula:) Tj
T* (     Generated Salary = Base Salary + Approved Allowances - Attendance Deductions - Other Deductions +/-) Tj
T* (Adjustments) Tj
T* (   - Lifecycle: Generated -> Approved -> Paid \(Full, Partial, or Later\).) Tj
T* (3. Doctor Commission Engine:) Tj
T* (   - Accrues from completed eligible service lines.) Tj
T* (   - Single-inclusion rule: A service line can only be included in ONE generated commission statement.) Tj
T* (   - Generation -> Approval -> Independent payout and outstanding tracking.) Tj
