(TASK: Refactor React Frontend to Remove LocalStorage Mock Data and Connect to Live Express Backend) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Context:) Tj
T* (Frontend in 'ch-sharif-and-saeed-hospital---hms' uses localStorage \(hms_patient_registry_v1, etc.\) and) Tj
T* (ModulePlaceholderView.) Tj
T* (Connect it to the backend running at http://localhost:5000/api/v1.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Instructions:) Tj
T* (1. Create Axios client in src/services/api/apiClient.ts:) Tj
T* (   - Base URL from VITE_API_URL or http://localhost:5000/api/v1.) Tj
T* (   - Request interceptor: Attach JWT Bearer token from AuthContext.) Tj
T* (   - Response interceptor: Handle 401 \(redirect to /login\), 403, and toast notifications.) Tj
T* (2. Refactor services in src/services/:) Tj
T* (   - Replace adminUserService.ts, patientRegistryService.ts, departmentService.ts, etc., with real async) Tj
T* (HTTP calls.) Tj
T* (   - Remove hardcoded mock arrays and localStorage keys.) Tj
T* (3. Replace ModulePlaceholderView.tsx with real working components:) Tj
T* (   - Front Desk Invoicing & Payment Collection screen.) Tj
T* (   - Cashier Balance Sheet & Account Settlement modal.) Tj
T* (   - Admission Bed Allocation & Dual Clearance screen.) Tj
T* (   - Inventory Requisition & Stock Ledger screen.) Tj
T* (   - Standalone Pharmacy Queue & Dispensing screen.) Tj
